  "selection_rules": [
    "Only one steady-state speaker renderer may process a block in the production path.",
    "Only one component owns adaptive sample-rate correction for any clock-domain crossing.",
    "RoomEQ generates correction intent; it does not run in Aurora's realtime callback.",
    "SOF may execute system DSP on supported i.MX8MP hardware but must preserve Aurora-owned coefficients and routing semantics.",
    "GenAVB/TSN, AOO, and ESP-AVB are alternate post-DSP transports for a given endpoint and never process that endpoint concurrently.",
    "ESP-AVB plus ESP-PTP may be selected only behind Aurora's network-worker boundary; their PTP/gPTP mapping must not redefine Aurora's logical media timeline.",
    "The pinned ESP-AVB source is only a stereo-per-stream embedded endpoint candidate; 7.1.4 requires explicit multi-endpoint channel mapping, synchronization, loss/reconnect, and physical RF evidence before selection.",
    "No external project type crosses Aurora's public runtime contracts directly."
  ]
